Scenario: View Automatic And Custom Image Variant I Ds
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Adaptive Media|
	When AdaptiveMedia add Image Resolution
		|imageName|Small Image Variant|
		|maxHeight|100|
		|maxWidth|100|
	And AdaptiveMedia goto Image Variant Entry
		|imageName|Small Image Variant|
	And AdaptiveMedia view Image Variant ID
		|imageVariantID|small-image-variant|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Adaptive Media|
	And AdaptiveMedia edit Image Resolution
		|imageName|Small Image Variant|
		|imageNameEdit|Edited Small Image Variant|
	And AdaptiveMedia goto Image Variant Entry
		|imageName|Edited Small Image Variant|
	And AdaptiveMedia view Image Variant ID
		|imageVariantID|edited-small-image-variant|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Adaptive Media|
	And AdaptiveMedia add Image Resolution
		|customID|custom-id|
		|imageName|Image Variant With Custom ID|
		|maxHeight|200|
		|maxWidth|200|
	And AdaptiveMedia goto Image Variant Entry
		|imageName|Image Variant With Custom ID|
	And AdaptiveMedia view Image Variant ID
		|imageVariantID|custom-id|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Adaptive Media|
	And AdaptiveMedia edit Image Resolution
