		|imageNameEdit|Custom ID Should Not Change|
	And AdaptiveMedia goto Image Variant Entry
		|imageName|Custom ID Should Not Change|
	Then AdaptiveMedia view Image Variant ID
		|imageVariantID|custom-id|
